dsh-library README · 1) 装进 profile（官方 CLI 负责 bundle 层）：& 'F:\DSH\resources\runtime\cli\bin\dsh.cmd' plugin --profile desktop add 'D:\dsh-library'
```

然后编辑 `C:\Users\<你>\.dsh\profiles\desktop\package.json`：

1. 把依赖规格从 `link:` 改成 `file:`（`file:` 让 pnpm 复制成实体目录，解析链才完整）；json
{
  "dependencies": { "dsh-library": "file:D:/dsh-library" },
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["…", "dsh-library"] } }
}
```

